- Biomedical signal processing
- Wearable health-monitoring research
- Exploring single-sensor sleep-monitoring systems

Project Scope:

This project is an experimental ECG-based apnea detection implementation.

The primary objective is to explore the relationship between ECG-derived respiratory features and apnea-related signal changes.

It does not replace a clinically validated sleep study or diagnostic device.
